# The pronunciation pack is a build artefact of tools/tts-build.mjs, but it ships with
# the app: the Pi should never need an Azure credential just to say a word out loud.
# One LFS object rather than 6,153 loose files keeps checkout to a single transfer and
# keeps the binary out of ordinary git history, which matters if the voice ever changes.
assets/audio.pack filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Keep line endings sane across Windows and the Pi.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.mp3 binary
*.pack binary
